OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FBecoming windy this morning
OL,6,Fwith outbreaks of rain for most,
OL,7,Fheaviest and most persistent on
OL,8,Fwestern hills. Eventually drier and
OL,9,Fbrighter this afternoon as rain clears
OL,10,Fsouth, however a few isolated showers
OL,11,Fare still likely. Strong winds easing
OL,12,Fwith time.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FClear spells and isolated
OL,15,Fshowers this evening, winds continuing
OL,16,Fto ease. Variable cloud later in the
OL,17,Fnight but extensively fine and dry.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
