OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FWidely bright or sunny with
OL,6,Flight winds during the day. Small
OL,7,Fchance of a localised shower early
OL,8,Fmorning, otherwise dry. Temperatures a
OL,9,Flittle lower compared to Saturday.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FMostly
OL,12,Ffine, bright to start Monday, becoming
OL,13,Fwarm. Occasional rain, stronger winds
OL,14,Fdeveloping later. Cooler by Tuesday,
OL,15,Fwith bright or sunny spells and
OL,16,Fisolated blustery showers. Similar on
OL,17,FWednesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
